 "notes": [
  "signRegionDiffPx = pixels (diff>24) in the sign band between the live page and the bare scene with all content hidden: 0 means nothing drew over the sign.",
  "restCanopyVsScene compares the band with and without the canopy at scroll 0: max channel difference 0-8 (image resampling), no visible seam.",
  "Pre-existing, not changed: choosing an age from the compact bar while scrolled into the cards can jump the page (393 portrait: 600 -> 1078) because the browser's scroll anchoring follows a card that moves in the new list; with overflow-anchor disabled it stays at 600. Same result on the previous build.",
  "Early scroll to 500 before hydration: scene and canopy moved together (-26.15px) pre-hydration; after hydration scrollY read 502 (2px, not investigated).",
  "Headline gap below sign is unchanged; the fade only appears once content has moved toward the sign. During the 0.6s arrival animation the headline starts 14px higher and its top few px may briefly sit under the sign edge (not measured).",
  "Not checked: WebKit/Safari, physical iPhone/iPad, 1024x768, return-from-game restore with the canopy (driver math and restore code unchanged)."
 ]
